# --- Double-blind hygiene -------------------------------------------------
# This repository is mirrored verbatim to an anonymous host, so anything below
# would be served as-is to reviewers. Keep it out of the tree entirely rather
# than relying on remembering not to `git add` it.
*OpenReview*.pdf            # reviewer threads carry the author list in rebuttals
*评审意见*.pdf               # internal review-response drafts
neurips2026_supplementary.zip
*.tex.bak*
*.py.bak
lemo_deck_test.py
